WEBVTT

1
00:00:06.992 --> 00:00:17.661
King Jolliginki and Queen Ermintrude lived deep in the jungle.

2
00:00:18.222 --> 00:00:20.364
Dr. Dolittle now stood before them.

3
00:00:20.384 --> 00:00:22.505
"What is your business here?"

4
00:00:23.066 --> 00:00:24.547
King Jolliginki roared.

5
00:00:25.148 --> 00:00:27.850
His voice was much louder than that of most men.

6
00:00:28.390 --> 00:00:30.072
That's why it sounded like a roar.

7
00:00:31.848 --> 00:00:34.690
Dr. Dolittle explained why he came to Africa.

8
00:00:35.551 --> 00:00:36.952
The king listened carefully.

9
00:00:36.972 --> 00:00:41.235
"May I travel through your land to help the monkeys?"

10
00:00:41.755 --> 00:00:43.196
the doctor asked politely.

11
00:00:43.216 --> 00:00:46.879
"No!" the king shook his head.

12
00:00:47.699 --> 00:00:50.001
Dr. Dolittle could not believe his ears.

13
00:00:50.021 --> 00:00:52.122
"Why not, your Majesty?"

14
00:00:52.483 --> 00:00:53.023
he asked.

15
00:00:53.043 --> 00:00:57.086
"Many years ago," replied the king.

16
00:00:57.106 --> 00:00:59.868
"I allowed a man to go through my land.

17
00:01:00.868 --> 00:01:03.750
I was kind to him, but do you know what he did?

18
00:01:04.470 --> 00:01:09.473
He killed my elephants, dug up my gold, and chopped down my trees!

19
00:01:10.934 --> 00:01:13.795
I will never again let a stranger go through my land.

20
00:01:14.276 --> 00:01:18.138
NEVER!" King Jolliginki turned to his guards.

21
00:01:18.158 --> 00:01:19.699
"To the dungeon!"

22
00:01:20.039 --> 00:01:20.559
he ordered.

23
00:01:21.380 --> 00:01:24.801
Dr. Dolittle and the animals were dragged away to the dungeon.

24
00:01:26.162 --> 00:01:28.984
It was cold, dirty, and dark in the dungeon.

25
00:01:30.092 --> 00:01:33.395
"I wish we had never come here," cried Gub-Gub.

26
00:01:33.935 --> 00:01:35.336
Then he started to cry.

27
00:01:35.356 --> 00:01:38.759
"Be quiet or else I'll hit you!"

28
00:01:39.199 --> 00:01:40.120
Chee-Chee warned.

29
00:01:40.140 --> 00:01:42.062
"Dr. Dolittle!

30
00:01:42.382 --> 00:01:43.583
Dr. Dolittle!"

31
00:01:44.123 --> 00:01:45.584
The animals surrounded him.

32
00:01:45.604 --> 00:01:48.306
"Is everyone here?"

33
00:01:48.867 --> 00:01:50.148
Dr. Dolittle blinked.

34
00:01:50.168 --> 00:01:55.272
"No. We can't find Polynesia," Jip replied sadly.

35
00:01:56.684 --> 00:01:57.565
"Oh, no!

36
00:01:57.705 --> 00:02:00.487
Polynesia! Polynesia!"

37
00:02:01.228 --> 00:02:04.251
Dr. Dolittle looked around for his beloved bird.

38
00:02:04.271 --> 00:02:06.693
"SSSSH! I'm here!"

39
00:02:07.493 --> 00:02:09.155
whispered a voice from the window.

40
00:02:09.955 --> 00:02:10.956
They all looked up.

41
00:02:10.976 --> 00:02:13.618
"POLYNESIA!" they shouted.

42
00:02:13.638 --> 00:02:16.801
"SHHHHHHH! Quiet!

43
00:02:17.201 --> 00:02:18.622
The guards will hear you!"

44
00:02:19.403 --> 00:02:20.624
Polynesia whispered.

45
00:02:20.644 --> 00:02:24.367
"You must get us out of here, Polynesia," Dr.

46
00:02:24.407 --> 00:02:25.248
Dolittle pleaded.

47
00:02:26.636 --> 00:02:27.737
"Don't worry, Dr.

48
00:02:27.777 --> 00:02:32.520
Dolittle," Polynesia comforted him, "I already have a plan."

49
00:02:32.540 --> 00:02:35.582
"YIPPPIE! Polynesia will get us out!"

50
00:02:36.063 --> 00:02:37.083
shouted Gub-Gub.

51
00:02:40.366 --> 00:02:43.788
That night, Polynesia flew into the king's bedroom.

52
00:02:44.369 --> 00:02:45.850
She pretended to be Dr.

53
00:02:45.890 --> 00:02:48.471
Dolittle. "King Jolliginki!"

54
00:02:48.952 --> 00:02:51.173
Polynesia said in the doctor's voice.

55
00:02:51.193 --> 00:02:54.636
"Huh? Ermintrude, is that you?"

56
00:02:55.332 --> 00:02:57.013
The king thought it was the queen.

57
00:02:57.033 --> 00:02:59.133
"King Jolliginki!"

58
00:02:59.653 --> 00:03:01.554
the bird called out, more loudly.

59
00:03:01.574 --> 00:03:03.074
"Who's there?

60
00:03:03.814 --> 00:03:04.655
Show yourself!"

61
00:03:05.235 --> 00:03:06.475
King Jolliginki said.

62
00:03:06.495 --> 00:03:10.296
"I am the great Dr.

63
00:03:10.376 --> 00:03:12.637
Dolittle!" Polynesia replied.

64
00:03:12.657 --> 00:03:14.558
"Show yourself!"

65
00:03:15.138 --> 00:03:16.818
repeated the terrified king.

66
00:03:16.838 --> 00:03:22.580
"Listen to me, foolish king," Polynesia said in a low voice.

67
00:03:23.764 --> 00:03:26.386
King Jolliginki was getting very scared.

68
00:03:26.406 --> 00:03:28.887
"You are in my dungeon!

69
00:03:29.467 --> 00:03:30.708
How can you speak to me?"

70
00:03:31.188 --> 00:03:31.749
he cried.

71
00:03:31.769 --> 00:03:34.830
"Of course you cannot see me.

72
00:03:34.850 --> 00:03:37.932
I am invisible," Polynesia laughed.

73
00:03:39.173 --> 00:03:41.194
"No, that's impossible!"

74
00:03:41.854 --> 00:03:44.035
His voice sounded squeaky and high.

75
00:03:44.055 --> 00:03:45.716
"Let us go!"

76
00:03:46.197 --> 00:03:47.497
Polynesia commanded.

77
00:03:47.517 --> 00:03:49.979
"NO! I can't!"

78
00:03:50.859 --> 00:03:51.880
the king sobbed.

79
00:03:52.624 --> 00:03:56.066
"If you don't, then I will make you sick like the monkeys!"

80
00:03:56.086 --> 00:03:59.247
"Who is the king talking to?"

81
00:03:59.947 --> 00:04:01.528
wondered Queen Ermintrude.

82
00:04:03.349 --> 00:04:05.169
The king did not want to suffer.

83
00:04:05.189 --> 00:04:07.150
"Guards! Guards!

84
00:04:07.891 --> 00:04:08.891
Release the prisoners!"

85
00:04:09.391 --> 00:04:09.991
he roared.

86
00:04:10.612 --> 00:04:12.793
The guards ran toward the dungeon.

87
00:04:13.393 --> 00:04:15.334
Polynesia flew out the window.

88
00:04:16.534 --> 00:04:19.976
At that moment, Queen Ermintrude turned and saw her.

89
00:04:21.176 --> 00:04:22.857
"What is that parrot doing here?"

90
00:04:23.658 --> 00:04:25.159
she asked her puzzled husband.

91
00:04:26.840 --> 00:04:28.961
Polynesia had no time to waste.

92
00:04:30.182 --> 00:04:30.922
"Dr. Dolittle!

93
00:04:31.202 --> 00:04:31.663
Wake up!

94
00:04:32.083 --> 00:04:32.783
Get ready!"

95
00:04:33.384 --> 00:04:34.064
she gasped.

96
00:04:34.845 --> 00:04:38.487
Before the doctor could answer, the guards opened the door.

97
00:04:38.507 --> 00:04:42.069
"By the king's orders, you are free to go!"

98
00:04:42.589 --> 00:04:43.430
shouted a guard.

99
00:04:43.450 --> 00:04:45.271
"Quickly! Doctor!

100
00:04:45.531 --> 00:04:46.172
Follow me!"

101
00:04:46.988 --> 00:04:49.410
Polynesia said in the animal language.

102
00:04:49.430 --> 00:04:51.931
"Stop! Stop!

103
00:04:52.292 --> 00:04:53.893
Don't let the prisoners go!"

104
00:04:54.733 --> 00:04:56.375
The king ran toward the dungeon.

105
00:04:57.275 --> 00:04:59.237
The king now knew he had been tricked.

106
00:04:59.837 --> 00:05:04.180
"It was the parrot pretending to be the doctor," his wife had said.

107
00:05:04.600 --> 00:05:05.701
But it was too late.

108
00:05:06.582 --> 00:05:08.763
The doctor and all his animals were gone.
